    <string name="about">about</string>
    <string name="about_window_text">"Anti-Ad" interrupts Spotify advertisements by force-stopping Spotify when an ad is detected, then relaunching and resuming playback. It works by utilizing notifications posted by Spotify. Only notifications from Spotify are accessed for identification and discarded immediately.         <![CDATA[This app is OpenSource.]]>
        <![CDATA[<br/><br/>]]>
        <![CDATA[<b>
        Designed to be minimal &amp; lightweight, ~150KB.</b>]]>
        <![CDATA[<br/><br/>]]>
        <![CDATA[<b>
        If you face issues or want a new feature, kindly open an issue on GitHub.</b>]]>
        <![CDATA[<br/><br/>]]>
        <![CDATA[<b>
        SECURITY WARNING: Only install from trusted sources. Bad actors can modify the code from other sources to read your notifications. If you got this from elsewhere, uninstall it immediately!</b>]]>
    </string>
